<p>The bigger package is not always the better deal. Stores count on you assuming it is. This tool does the one bit of math that cuts through the packaging games: the price per unit. Punch in two or three options and it tells you which one actually saves you money, and by how much.</p>

<div class="upc">
  <h3>The Unit Price Comparison</h3>
  <p class="upc-sub">Enter the price and the size (ounces, pounds, count, whatever, just keep it the same for each). The cheapest per unit wins.</p>

